  "sourceTitle": "Molasses Cookies",
  "sourceText": "Molasses Cookies\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, December 5, 2009 - 12:26am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup sugar\n1/2 teaspoon ginger\n1 cup molasses\n5 teaspoons soda\n1/4 teaspoon allspice\n1 teaspoon cinnamon\n1 cup lard\n1 cup buttermilk or sour milk\n2 pieces eggs\n1/4 teaspoon cloves\n2 1/2 cups all purpose flour\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix well all ingredients, and flour to thicken.  2 May be rolled out in balls or dropped on greased cookie sheet. 3  Bake at 375 degrees for 10 minutes.",
